---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ObservatoryHero from '../components/hero/ObservatoryHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="LatentSig · AI Platforms, Intelligent Agents & Digital Applications" description="We research, design, and build AI systems, annotation and verification platforms, and web and mobile applications. From early exploration to practical implementation.">
  <ObservatoryHero />
  <section class="home-section products-section"><div class="home-wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p>PRODUCTS &amp; APPLICATIONS</p><h2>Three ways to turn ideas into useful systems.</h2><a href="/products/">Explore all products <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="home-product-grid">
    <a class="home-product" href="/products/annotation-verification/"><div class="product-graphic data-graphic"><span>RAW DATA</span><b>→</b><span>ANNOTATE</span><b>→</b><span>VERIFY</span></div><small>PRODUCT CONCEPT</small><h3>Annotation &amp; Verification Platform</h3><p>From raw data to reviewed, reliable datasets.</p><span class="card-link">Explore concept ↗</span></a>
    <a class="home-product" href="/products/agentic-ai-platform/"><div class="product-graphic agent-graphic"><span>REQUEST</span><i>↓</i><span>WORKFLOW</span><i>↓</i><span>RESULT</span></div><small>PRODUCT CONCEPT</small><h3>Agentic AI Platform</h3><p>Make AI workflows easier to reason about.</p><span class="card-link">Explore concept ↗</span></a>
    <a class="home-product" href="/products/web-mobile-apps/"><div class="product-graphic app-graphic"><span>WEB</span><span>MOBILE</span></div><small>SERVICE CAPABILITY</small><h3>Web &amp; Mobile Applications</h3><p>Digital products designed around real work.</p><span class="card-link">Explore capability ↗</span></a>
  </div><p class="illustration-note">Product concept illustrations are drawn for this site and do not depict available software.</p></div></section>
  <section class="home-section workflow-section"><div class="home-wrap workflow-wrap"><div><p class="section-kicker">A PRACTICAL WORKFLOW</p><h2>From a real problem to a system people can use.</h2><p>Start with the decision or task that matters. Explore the right approach, build a focused solution, then learn from how it works in practice.</p></div><div class="workflow-steps"><article><span>01</span><h3>Research</h3><p>Clarify the problem and evaluate the options.</p></article><b aria-hidden="true">→</b><article><span>02</span><h3>Design</h3><p>Shape the workflow, data, and experience.</p></article><b aria-hidden="true">→</b><article><span>03</span><h3>Build</h3><p>Implement, review, and refine the system.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="home-section research-section"><div class="home-wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p>RESEARCH &amp; INSIGHTS</p><h2>Ideas with the engineering details attached.</h2><a href="/insights/">Read Insights <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="research-cards">
    <a href="/insights/laya-rlcd-system-one/"><img src="/images/research/laya/laya-rlcd-system-one-hero.jpg" alt="Illustration of signals flowing into a decision core" loading="lazy"/><span>RESEARCH</span><h3>Laya and RLCD: fast decisions for AI workflows</h3></a>
    <a href="/insights/dflash-muse-spark-1-2/"><img src="/images/research/dflash/dflash-muse-spark-hero.jpg" alt="DFlash token blocks moving through a speculative decoding workflow" loading="lazy"/><span>ENGINEERING</span><h3>DFlash explained: how block-diffusion drafting works</h3></a>
    <a href="/blog/quantization-without-tears/"><div class="research-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">INT8<br/>PTQ</div><span>ENGINEERING</span><h3>INT8 post-training quantization without tears</h3></a>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="home-section services-section"><div class="home-wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p>HOW WE WORK</p><h2>Services for the steps between idea and implementation.</h2></div><div class="service-cards"><a href="/rd-advisory/"><span>01</span><h3>AI R&amp;D Advisory</h3><p>Explore feasibility, architecture, and research direction.</p><b>Explore service ↗</b></a><a href="/consulting/"><span>02</span><h3>AI Consulting</h3><p>Work through technical choices and workflow challenges.</p><b>Explore service ↗</b></a><a href="/implementation/"><span>03</span><h3>AI Implementation</h3><p>Design and build systems around practical requirements.</p><b>Explore service ↗</b></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="home-cta"><div class="home-wrap"><p class="section-kicker">START WITH THE PROBLEM</p><h2>What would you like to make possible?</h2><p>Bring us a workflow, a product idea, or a technical question. We can find a useful next step together.</p><div><a href="/contact/">Talk to LatentSig</a><a href="/demos/">Explore product demos</a></div></div></section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .home-section,.home-cta{font-family:Geist,system-ui,sans-serif}.home-wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:auto}.home-section{padding:82px 24px;background:#0b1020;color:#f2f0ff}.section-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:end;gap:4px 20px;margin-bottom:30px}.section-heading>p,.section-kicker{grid-column:1/-1;color:#c0c1ff;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 10px}.section-heading h2,.workflow-wrap h2,.home-cta h2{font:600 clamp(2.1rem,4vw,3.5rem)/1.08 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0;max-width:810px}.section-heading>a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;color:#c0c1ff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}.home-product-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.home-product{padding:13px 13px 22px;border-radius:11px;border:1px solid #373a50;background:#11182a;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .18s,transform .18s}.home-product:hover{border-color:#8985cd;transform:translateY(-3px)}.product-graphic{height:182px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:7px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#39346c55,transparent 65%),#0b1020;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;color:#dedcff;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.08em}.data-graphic{flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px}.data-graphic span{padding:10px;border:1px solid #666195;border-radius:5px;background:#171b31}.data-graphic b{color:#c0c1ff}.agent-graphic{flex-direction:column;gap:3px}.agent-graphic span{padding:8px 18px;border:1px solid #656191;border-radius:30px}.agent-graphic i{color:#c0c1ff;font-style:normal}.app-graphic span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:39%;height:112px;border:1px solid #656191;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#252344,#11182a)}.home-product>small,.research-cards>a>span{font-size:10px;color:#c0c1ff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.13em}.home-product h3{font:600 20px/1.25 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;margin:12px 0 8px}.home-product p{min-height:46px;color:#b7b5c9;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.card-link{display:block;margin-top:17px;color:#c0c1ff;font-weight:700;font-size:12px}.illustration-note{margin:14px 0 0;color:#9695aa;font-size:11px}.workflow-section{background:#080c18;border-block:1px solid #24293b}.workflow-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}.workflow-wrap>div:first-child>p:last-child,.home-cta .home-wrap>p:not(.section-kicker){color:#b7b5c9;line-height:1.7;font-size:15px}.workflow-steps{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.workflow-steps article{min-width:0;flex:1;padding:18px 14px;border:1px solid #383b51;border-radius:9px;background:#11182a}.workflow-steps article span,.service-cards>a>span{color:#c0c1ff;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em}.workflow-steps h3{font:600 17px 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;margin:13px 0 6px}.workflow-steps p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:#aaa9c1;margin:0}.workflow-steps>b{color:#c0c1ff}.research-section{background:#0e1424}.research-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.research-cards>a{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #34394f;border-radius:10px;background:#11182a;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;padding-bottom:18px}.research-cards img,.research-placeholder{display:grid;width:100%;height:170px;object-fit:cover;margin-bottom:16px}.research-placeholder{place-content:center;background:radial-gradient(circle,#514889,#101628 70%);font:700 23px/1.5 Geist,sans-serif;text-align:center;color:#d5d2ff;letter-spacing:.15em}.research-cards>a>span,.research-cards h3{margin-left:17px;margin-right:17px}.research-cards h3{font:600 17px/1.35 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;margin-top:9px;margin-bottom:0}.services-section{background:#0b1020}.service-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.service-cards>a{padding:23px;border:1px solid #35394e;border-radius:10px;background:#11182a;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.service-cards h3{font:600 19px 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif}.service-cards p{color:#afadc1;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;min-height:44px}.service-cards b{font-size:12px;color:#c0c1ff}.home-cta{padding:68px 24px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 50%,#39326755,transparent 55%),#0a0e1d;color:#f4f2ff}.home-cta .home-wrap{padding:clamp(28px,6vw,62px);border:1px solid #393c55;border-radius:13px;background:#101629}.home-cta h2{max-width:800px}.home-cta .home-wrap>p:not(.section-kicker){max-width:700px}.home-cta .home-wrap>div{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.home-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:46px;padding:0 17px;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;background:#c0c1ff;color:#17142f}.home-cta a+a{background:transparent;border:1px solid #4a4965;color:#e5e3f5}
  @media(max-width:800px){.home-product-grid,.research-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.workflow-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workflow-steps article{padding:15px 10px}}@media(max-width:540px){.home-section{padding:58px 18px}.home-product-grid,.research-cards,.service-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workflow-steps{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}.workflow-steps>b{align-self:center;transform:rotate(90deg)}.research-cards img,.research-placeholder{height:190px}}
</style>
